+# Wire map
+
+## codex-api/src
+
+- `codex-api/src/api_bridge.rs` — Translates `ApiError` and related HTTP/WebSocket error payloads into the internal error type. `codex-api/src/api_bridge.rs:21`
+- `codex-api/src/api_bridge_tests.rs` — Tests error translation for overload, policy, rate-limit, and identity-header cases. `codex-api/src/api_bridge_tests.rs:8`
+- `codex-api/src/auth.rs` — Defines the authentication-provider abstraction that applies auth headers to transport requests. `codex-api/src/auth.rs:30`
+- `codex-api/src/common.rs` — Defines shared Responses request, event, stream, safety, reasoning, and WebSocket-create wire types. `codex-api/src/common.rs:275`
+- `codex-api/src/error.rs` — Defines the crate's API and transport error taxonomy. `codex-api/src/error.rs:9`
+- `codex-api/src/files.rs` — Handles the OpenAI hosted-file upload flow: create, blob PUT, and finalize. `codex-api/src/files.rs:121`
+- `codex-api/src/images.rs` — Defines image generation/edit request and response DTOs. `codex-api/src/images.rs:5`
+- `codex-api/src/lib.rs` — Declares the crate modules and its public API re-exports. `codex-api/src/lib.rs:1`
+- `codex-api/src/provider.rs` — Models provider endpoints, Responses-versus-Chat wire selection, retry policy, and Azure detection. `codex-api/src/provider.rs:45`
+- `codex-api/src/rate_limits.rs` — Parses HTTP rate-limit headers and WebSocket rate-limit events into snapshots. `codex-api/src/rate_limits.rs:28`
+- `codex-api/src/safety_buffering.rs` — Reads safety-buffering headers into faster-model treatment metadata. `codex-api/src/safety_buffering.rs:8`
+- `codex-api/src/search.rs` — Defines search requests, operations, settings, filters, and response payloads. `codex-api/src/search.rs:9`
+- `codex-api/src/telemetry.rs` — Wraps wire requests with telemetry and defines SSE/WebSocket telemetry hooks. `codex-api/src/telemetry.rs:68`
+
+## codex-api/src/endpoint
+
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/compact.rs` — Posts conversation-compaction requests and captures returned turn state. `codex-api/src/endpoint/compact.rs:35`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/images.rs` — Posts image generation and edit requests and records the image request ID. `codex-api/src/endpoint/images.rs:40`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/memories.rs` — Posts memory trace-summarization requests and parses summaries. `codex-api/src/endpoint/memories.rs:33`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/mod.rs` — Declares endpoint modules and re-exports the endpoint client API. `codex-api/src/endpoint/mod.rs:12`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/models.rs` — Fetches the model catalog and ETag metadata. `codex-api/src/endpoint/models.rs:31`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_call.rs` — Creates WebRTC realtime calls with multipart or backend JSON and extracts the call ID. `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_call.rs:49`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/responses.rs` — Streams Responses or Chat Completions requests over the selected provider wire. `codex-api/src/endpoint/responses.rs:75`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/responses_websocket.rs` — Manages the Responses WebSocket connection and streams WebSocket events as `ResponseEvent`s. `codex-api/src/endpoint/responses_websocket.rs:375`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/search.rs` — Posts typed search requests to the search endpoint and parses results. `codex-api/src/endpoint/search.rs:32`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/session.rs` — Provides shared HTTP execution/streaming with provider request building, auth, retries, and telemetry. `codex-api/src/endpoint/session.rs:26`
+
+## codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket
+
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods.rs` — Implements the realtime WebSocket client, connection lifecycle, writer, events, transcript state, and URL construction. `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods.rs:777`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_common.rs` — Builds shared realtime outbound messages and session-update JSON. `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_common.rs:41`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_common_tests.rs` — Tests shared realtime outbound encoding and handoff behavior. `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_common_tests.rs:16`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_frameless_bidi.rs` — Builds frameless bidirectional outbound messages, including chunked context appends. `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_frameless_bidi.rs:13`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_frameless_bidi_tests.rs` — Tests frameless context chunking and session JSON encoding. `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_frameless_bidi_tests.rs:11`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_v1.rs` — Builds realtime WebSocket outbound messages for the v1 dialect. `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_v1.rs:18`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_v2.rs` — Builds v2 realtime session configuration, items, tool outputs, and modality/tool settings. `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_v2.rs:39`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/mod.rs` — Declares realtime WebSocket modules and re-exports their client and protocol API. `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/mod.rs:12`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol.rs` — Defines realtime parser selection, session configuration, and outbound wire message types. `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol.rs:263`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_common.rs` — Parses common realtime JSON payloads for session updates, transcripts, and errors. `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_common.rs:7`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_frameless_bidi.rs` — Parses frameless bidirectional realtime events. `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_frameless_bidi.rs:15`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_frameless_bidi_tests.rs` — Tests frameless compatibility with legacy delegation and transcript/audio events. `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_frameless_bidi_tests.rs:7`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_v1.rs` — Parses realtime WebSocket events for the v1 protocol. `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_v1.rs:12`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_v2.rs` — Parses realtime WebSocket events for the v2 protocol. `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_v2.rs:24`
+
+## codex-api/src/requests
+
+- `codex-api/src/requests/chat.rs` — Translates a Responses-shaped request into a Chat Completions request body. `codex-api/src/requests/chat.rs:19`
+- `codex-api/src/requests/headers.rs` — Builds session and subagent-related request headers. `codex-api/src/requests/headers.rs:5`
+- `codex-api/src/requests/mod.rs` — Declares request-translation modules and re-exports the compression setting. `codex-api/src/requests/mod.rs:1`
+- `codex-api/src/requests/responses.rs` — Defines the optional request compression wire format. `codex-api/src/requests/responses.rs:2`
+
+## codex-api/src/sse
+
+- `codex-api/src/sse/chat.rs` — Translates Chat Completions SSE deltas into Responses-shaped `ResponseEvent`s. `codex-api/src/sse/chat.rs:30`
+- `codex-api/src/sse/mod.rs` — Declares SSE modules and re-exports their stream handlers. `codex-api/src/sse/mod.rs:1`
+- `codex-api/src/sse/responses.rs` — Spawns and processes Responses SSE streams, including completion, metadata, rate-limit, and safety events. `codex-api/src/sse/responses.rs:36`

